  dialogueText: {fileID: 306969236}
  firstLine: Nice to see a new face. Welcome to the shop. You say you want to take
    on the  four beasts of the Black Sea? I can help with that. Just a warning though,
    most don't make it back alive. Here's 200 Aurum to start you off.  Feel free
    to use my trusty ship over there at the docks. Hold E at the ship's hull to repair
    it. Good luck.
  repeatLine: See anything you like?
